[111.371111, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m6\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[111.372508, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nimport mujoco, numpy as np, cProfile, pstats, io\r\nm=mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_path('model_ref.xml'); d=mujoco.MjData(m)\r\nd.qpos += np.random.default_rng(1).normal(0,.01,size=d.qpos.shape); mujoco.mj_forward(m,d)\r\npr=cProfile.Profile(); pr.enable()\r\nfor _ in range(2000): mujoco.mj_step(m,d)\r\npr.disable(); s=io.StringIO(); pstats.Stats(pr,stream=s).sort_stats('cumulative').print_stats(30); print(s.getvalue())\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[111.373069, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[112.167096, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[112.167448, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n         2001 function calls in 0.554 seconds\r\n\r\n   Ordered by: cumulative time\r\n\r\n   ncalls  tottime  percall  cumtime  percall filename:lineno(function)\r\n     2000    0.554    0.000    0.554    0.000 {built-in method mujoco._functions.mj_step}\r\n        1    0.000    0.000    0.000    0.000 {method 'disable' of '_lsprof.Profiler' objects}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[112.169024, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
