[210.126904, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m11\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[210.127728, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nimport mujoco, numpy as np, time\r\nfor f in ['model_ref.xml','model.xml']:\r\n m=mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_path(f)\r\n print(f,'solver',m.opt.solver,'it',m.opt.iterations,'tol',m.opt.tolerance,'ls',m.opt.ls_tolerance,'jac',m.opt.jacobian)\r\n d=mujoco.MjData(m); d.qpos += np.random.default_rng(1).normal(0,.01,size=d.qpos.shape); mujoco.mj_forward(m,d)\r\n t=time.perf_counter()\r\n for _ in range(1000): mujoco.mj_step(m,d)\r\n print('  time',time.perf_counter()-t)\r\n# interleaved 5 repeats\r\nmodels=[mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_path(f) for f in ['model_ref.xml','model.xml']]\r\nfor rep in range(3):\r\n for f,m in zip(['ref','cg'],models):\r\n  seeds=[rep*10+i for i in range(5)]\r\n  t=time.perf_counter()\r\n  for seed in seeds:\r\n   d=mujoco.MjData(m); d.qpos += np.random.default_rng(seed).normal(0,.01,size=d.qpos.shape); mujoco.mj_forward(m,d)\r\n   for _ in range(int(2/m.opt.timestep)): mujoco.mj_step(m,d)\r\n  print(rep,f,time.perf_counter()-t)\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[210.128035, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
