[348.570902, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m19\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[348.571362, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe tuned model switches the constraint solver from the default Newton solver to PGS while leaving all physical properties, geometry, timestep, and integration \r\nunchanged. This preserves the final full physics state within tolerance and reduces runtime to about 50% of the reference. I verified multiple evaluation runs \r\nand 120 additional randomized seeds with no correctness failures.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[348.571955, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[348.580392, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n<returncode>\r\n-1\r\n<output>\r\n\r\n<exception_info>\r\naction was not executed\r\n"]
